00:06:18.524 --> 00:06:21.259
<v Host>Quiz time. Three questions.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:26.779
<v Slow>6月5日は、何の日ですか。

00:06:27.579 --> 00:06:30.939
<v Host>What day is June fifth? It's Environment Day.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:37.204
<v Slow>日本では、6月を何と呼んでいますか。

00:06:38.004 --> 00:06:42.084
<v Host>What does Japan call the month of June? Environment Month.

00:06:42.684 --> 00:06:48.180
<v Slow>わたしたちには、どんなことができますか。

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:54.043
<v Host>What kinds of things can we do? Reduce trash, and use electricity carefully.

00:06:54.644 --> 00:07:07.028
<v Host>That's today's Japanese Daily News. Full transcript with furigana at podcast.jpnotes.dev. Subscribe on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. See you tomorrow.

